(7335004, 1144327, 179761, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by herfotoman:</b></div><hr/><i> I like the cat. </i></td></tr></table>took me a long time to find the cat.... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I thought herfotoman was being facetious until your follow up. Now it''s the only thing I see!<br/> <br/>Thanks for the fantasy art selection :)</td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: Originally posted by herfotoman: I like the cat. took me a long time to find the cat....   I thought herfotoman was being facetious until your follow up. Now it''s the only thing I see! Thanks for the fantasy art selection :)', '2015-03-27 19:12:05.000000', NULL, 0),
